Package: BayesianTrial
Title: Bayesian Decision-Making for Clinical Trials
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Jiangyan", family = "Zhao", email = "zhaojy2017@126.com", role = c("cre", "aut")),
    person(given = "Rongji", family = "Mu", email = "rjmu@sjtu.edu.cn", role = "aut")
  )
Maintainer: Jiangyan Zhao <zhaojy2017@126.com>
Description: Calculate posterior and predictive probabilities and evaluate
    operating characteristics for Bayesian clinical trial decision rules.
    The current implementation supports two-stage single-arm trials with
    binary endpoints, Beta priors, and Monte Carlo simulation.
